36
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:45,940
这是谁
Who's this?

37
00:01:53,270 --> 00:01:56,440
-她真烦人  -可不是吗
- She's annoying. - Tell me about it.

38
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:19,970
亚历山德拉去哪了
Where's Alexandra?

39
00:02:27,210 --> 00:02:28,280
趴下
Get down!

40
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,560
老兄  放开我
Dude, get off me.

41
00:02:49,060 --> 00:02:50,710
派对开始了
Now it's a goddamn party.

42
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:52,850
-这些人是谁  -他们想抓丹尼
- Who are these people? - They want Danny.

43
00:03:00,050 --> 00:03:01,970
我们要活的
We want him alive.

44
00:03:08,700 --> 00:03:10,180
该死
Oh, shit.

45
00:03:20,580 --> 00:03:24,520
通力合作  我们就能活着出去
We work together, we walk out of here alive.

46
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:30,500
不
No!

47
00:03:36,390 --> 00:03:38,160
等等  我只想和你谈谈
Wait, I just wanna talk to you.

48
00:03:50,130 --> 00:03:52,140
马特在哪  他在想什么
Where's Matt? What's he thinking?

49
00:03:52,140 --> 00:03:54,310
他没动脑子  专心点
He's not. Stay with me!

50
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:02,930
这不是真正的你
This is not who you are.

51
00:04:05,630 --> 00:04:06,740
我了解你
I know you.

52
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:21,230
你死了
You died.

53
00:04:22,950 --> 00:04:24,390
我把你抱在怀里
I held you in my arms.

54
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,530
我把你埋了  艾丽卡
I buried you, Elektra!

55
00:04:42,010 --> 00:04:43,050
艾丽卡
Elektra.

56
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:47,310
那是你的名字
That's your name.

57
00:04:49,410 --> 00:04:50,400
艾丽卡
Elektra.

58
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:03,220
他们对你做了什么
What have they done to you?

59
00:05:06,940 --> 00:05:07,930
你在干什么
What are you doing?

60
00:05:07,930 --> 00:05:09,280
我能帮你  艾丽卡
I can help you, Elektra!

61
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:19,710
他们说你无坚不摧
They say you can't be broken.

62
00:05:20,500 --> 00:05:22,010
我们走着瞧吧
We'll see about that.

63
00:05:34,940 --> 00:05:35,940
卢克
Luke!

64
00:05:55,540 --> 00:05:57,180
快抓住他
Get him, now.

65
00:06:14,670 --> 00:06:15,770
我们走  孩子
Let's go, kid.

66
00:06:18,180 --> 00:06:20,010
-卢克呢  -他们抓走了他
- Where's Luke? - They took him.

67
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:23,100
-更多人在后面  -马上不会了
- More comin'. - Not for long.

68
00:06:25,310 --> 00:06:26,250
我们走
Let's go.

69
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:28,620
这边来  伙计们
Get over here, guys!

70
00:06:35,620 --> 00:06:37,280
闻着像屎一样
Smells like shit.

71
00:06:37,630 --> 00:06:39,500
只有这一条路撤退
It's our only way out.

72
00:07:00,500 --> 00:07:04,010
他们去哪了  黑空呢
Where did they go? And where's the Black Sky?

73
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:07,080
这该问我们的领袖
That's a question for our leader.

74
00:07:28,990 --> 00:07:30,010
丹尼
Danny!

75
00:07:30,780 --> 00:07:32,900
-很高兴见到你  -你去哪了
- Man, am I glad to see you. - Where've you been?

76
00:07:32,900 --> 00:07:35,620
我会解释一切  不过有客人来了
I'll explain everything, but first... we have company.

77
00:07:35,620 --> 00:07:36,590
客人
Company?

78
00:07:38,460 --> 00:07:40,180
我说过会带他回来
I said I'd bring him back.

79
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:41,670
发生了什么
What happened?

80
00:07:41,950 --> 00:07:44,400
手和会袭击了我们  抓走了卢克
The Hand attacked us. They took Luke.

81
00:07:45,100 --> 00:07:47,050
你怎么确定他们没跟你到这
How do you know they didn't follow you here?

82
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:50,220
没人跟踪我们
We're clear.

83
00:07:51,590 --> 00:07:55,280
-什么  -我们所到之处不会安全太久
- What? - No place we land will stay safe for long.

84
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:57,780
-我们不能一直逃避  -我不要跑
- We can't keep running forever. - I'm not running, period.

85
00:07:57,780 --> 00:07:59,700
我们公司在附近有一栋楼
My company owns a building not far from here.

86
00:07:59,700 --> 00:08:02,730
我们不需要藏身处  我们需要了结这件事
We don't need another hideout. We just need for this to be over.

87
00:08:02,730 --> 00:08:04,680
-你想得太简单了  -是吗
- You're oversimplifying it. - Oh, am I?

88
00:08:04,690 --> 00:08:07,270
也许只有我没拿这件事追求一时的刺激
Or am I the only one of us who isn't in this for a cheap thrill?

89
00:08:07,270 --> 00:08:09,980
-杰西卡  -上次我们确实有个计划
- Jessica. - And the last time we did have a plan,

90
00:08:09,980 --> 00:08:13,170
这家伙却丢下我们  跑去打那个穿紧身衣的妞
but this one left us to go fight that chick in the spandex.

91
00:08:13,170 --> 00:08:15,180
对  就像中城圈那次一样
Yeah. Just like he did in Midland Circle.

92
00:08:15,180 --> 00:08:16,800
我犯了个错误  我以为
I made a mistake. I thought...

93
00:08:28,870 --> 00:08:29,880
卢克
Luke?

94
00:08:31,110 --> 00:08:32,919
-发生什么了  -你还好吗
- What happened? - Are you okay?

95
00:08:33,390 --> 00:08:34,360
我没事
I'm fine.

96
00:08:36,130 --> 00:08:40,179
事实上  我好极了
Actually, I'm, uh... I'm better than fine.

97
00:08:47,170 --> 00:08:48,540
我抓住了一个他们的人
I got one of theirs.

98
00:10:25,420 --> 00:10:27,430
你武艺精湛了  孩子
You're skilled, my child.

99
00:10:28,750 --> 00:10:30,330
当你战斗时  很明显
It's clear, watching you fight,

100
00:10:30,330 --> 00:10:34,120
你会运用的招数比别人一辈子会的都多
that you know much more than anyone can learn in a single life.

101
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:39,020
这是在夸你
That's a compliment.

102
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:42,560
他们也对我说过同样的话
They've said the same thing about me.

103
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:46,590
你把我训练得很好
You've trained me well.

104
00:10:53,590 --> 00:10:55,420
我曾有个女儿
I had a daughter once.

105
00:10:56,710 --> 00:10:58,900
是在第一轮生命的时候
This was in my first life.

106
00:11:00,340 --> 00:11:04,030
那时我还没去昆仑朝圣
Before I made the pilgrimage to K'un-Lun.

107
00:11:04,940 --> 00:11:07,170
还不知道圣物
Before I learned of the substance.

108
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:10,060
也还没建立这个组织
And before I started the organization.

109
00:11:11,490 --> 00:11:14,420
她很聪明  和善
And she was intelligent, kind...

110
00:11:16,940 --> 00:11:21,360
但在我战胜死亡前  它却夺走了她
And death took her from me before I learned how to defeat it.

111
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:25,540
在悲痛中  别人告诉我
In my grief, people told me

112
00:11:25,540 --> 00:11:27,760
她太单纯美好  不该来这个世界
that she was too good for this world.

113
00:11:28,160 --> 00:11:29,460
我不相信他们
I didn't believe them.

114
00:11:30,730 --> 00:11:33,280
但他们说的也不全错
But there was some truth in what they said.

115
00:11:34,710 --> 00:11:36,230
她不是个勇士
She wasn't a warrior.

116
00:11:37,780 --> 00:11:39,470
她不像你我一样
She wasn't like you and me.

117
00:11:41,530 --> 00:11:42,810
现在我知道了
And now I know...

118
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:46,050
我压根不该养育她
I was never meant to raise her.

119
00:11:47,020 --> 00:11:49,430
我该养育的是黑空
I was meant to raise the Black Sky.

120
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:53,710
我很感激有你
I'm grateful for you.

121
00:11:56,740 --> 00:11:59,370
起死回生时  你没有选择
You had no choice in returning from death.

122
00:11:59,550 --> 00:12:01,070
我理解
I realize that.

123
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:04,070
但我希望你明白
But I hope you understand

124
00:12:04,070 --> 00:12:07,530
作为一件抵御敌人的武器
that this is the life you were chosen to lead,

125
00:12:07,660 --> 00:12:10,570
这才是你的宿命
as a weapon against our enemies.

126
00:12:18,070 --> 00:12:20,470
如果你不能完成这个使命
If you do not fulfill that role...

127
00:12:22,220 --> 00:12:24,260
你对手和会就没有价值
you're of no use to the Hand.

128
00:12:25,170 --> 00:12:26,270
对我也是
Or to me.

129
00:12:30,550 --> 00:12:32,280
当然
Of course not.

130
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,400
有新消息
I have news.

131
00:12:46,970 --> 00:12:48,750
索旺达被抓走了
Sowande has been taken.

132
00:12:49,050 --> 00:12:50,140
被谁
By whom?

133
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:52,900
应该是铁拳和他的盟友
We can only assume it was the Iron Fist and his allies.

134
00:12:54,370 --> 00:12:55,310
这些年来
Over the years,

135
00:12:55,310 --> 00:12:58,620
我们五个每次都能化险为夷
the five of us have escaped every manner of danger and death.

136
00:12:58,620 --> 00:13:00,770
他会回来找我们的
He will find his way back to us.

137
00:13:01,150 --> 00:13:02,610
与此同时  通知其他人
In the meantime, tell the others

138
00:13:02,610 --> 00:13:06,380
我们南美的援军很快就到
that our reinforcement from South America will be arriving soon.

139
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:10,520
与之合作  我们将扩大对铁拳的搜寻
And together, we will expand our search for the Iron Fist.

140
00:13:11,710 --> 00:13:12,930
好的
I will.

141
00:13:15,510 --> 00:13:18,890
还有件事必须讨论一下
There is something else we must discuss.

142
00:13:22,340 --> 00:13:23,470
换个时间
Later.

143
00:13:24,230 --> 00:13:25,410
好的
As you wish.

144
00:13:45,750 --> 00:13:47,040
你觉得他还会晕多久
How long do you think he'll be out?

145
00:13:47,050 --> 00:13:49,100
-没多久了  -你怎么知道
- Not much longer. - How do you know?

146
00:13:49,100 --> 00:13:50,630
因为我会这样
Because this is happening.

147
00:13:54,810 --> 00:13:56,400
你来纽约做什么
What are you doing in New York?

148
00:13:56,910 --> 00:13:59,510
无论如何我也不会背叛自己的盟友
There's nothing you can do to make me betray my own.

149
00:13:59,510 --> 00:14:01,000
我愿接受挑战
I'm up for the challenge.

150
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:04,180
别麻烦了  五指都是在昆仑选中的
Don't bother. The fingers were cast out of K'un-Lun.

151
00:14:04,180 --> 00:14:08,400
这意味着他是跟随养育铁拳的僧人训练的
Which means he trained with the same monks that raised him.

152
00:14:08,820 --> 00:14:11,550
-所以呢  -让我们接受严苛考验
- So? - Put us through brutal trials.

153
00:14:11,550 --> 00:14:13,200
这叫戒律
It's called discipline.

154
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:14,950
也就意味着他不会松口
It means he won't crack.

155
00:14:15,990 --> 00:14:17,150
不能靠武力
Not by force.

156
00:14:17,150 --> 00:14:19,810
你对手和会的力量一无所知
You know nothing of the power of the Hand.

157
00:14:20,370 --> 00:14:22,840
你就是落入深井的老鼠
You are mice who fell into a well.

158
00:14:23,260 --> 00:14:25,340
相信我  你会淹死的
Believe me, this will drown you.

159
00:14:25,770 --> 00:14:27,260
你想把我的城市怎么样
What do you want with our city?

160
00:14:28,790 --> 00:14:30,080
你的城市
Your city?

161
00:14:31,010 --> 00:14:34,660
这地方属于手和会  一直如此
This place belongs to the Hand. It always has.

162
00:14:34,660 --> 00:14:35,920
"一直"是什么意思
What do you mean, "Always"?

163
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:38,190
我查到他们最早成立于1820年
I traced it back to 1820.

164
00:14:38,190 --> 00:14:41,100
-就这样  -你们为什么想抓丹尼·兰德
- That's all? - Why do you want Danny Rand?

165
00:14:41,260 --> 00:14:43,440
你永远不会为你们效力
Nothing you can do can make me serve you.

166
00:14:44,510 --> 00:14:48,310
-你明白吗  -我明白吗
- Do you understand? - Do I understand?

167
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:51,490
你是最蠢的一任铁拳了
You are the dumbest Iron Fist yet.

168
00:14:53,570 --> 00:14:56,530
告诉我你们为什么要抓我
Tell me what you want with me.

169
00:14:57,210 --> 00:14:58,850
我们要的是拳
We want the Fist.

170
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:00,370
你毫无价值
You are nothing.

171
00:15:01,330 --> 00:15:04,100
丹尼·兰德辜负了整座城市
Danny Rand failed an entire city.

172
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:06,830
他本该誓死保护这个地方
The place he was sworn to protect.

173
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:11,130
正如那个无坚不摧的家伙任由那个男孩死在监狱
The same way the unbreakable one let that boy die in a jail cell.

174
00:15:11,560 --> 00:15:13,760
害怕而又孤单
Afraid and alone.

175
00:15:15,050 --> 00:15:17,800
正如那个女人没能救到那个建筑师
The same way the woman couldn't save the architect.

176
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:18,980
哪里出错了
What's wrong?

177
00:15:19,040 --> 00:15:22,170
我也像他之前那样  控制了你的大脑吗
Have I gotten in your head the same way he did long ago?

178
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:27,710
还有你曾爱的那些人
What about the ones you still love?

179
00:15:28,130 --> 00:15:30,370
你离开之后  他们会怎么样
What will become of them once you are gone?

180
00:15:30,370 --> 00:15:33,760
-还有谁因你而死  -你在说什么
- Who else must die because of you? - What are you talking about?

181
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:37,090
那个护士  广播台的那个女人
The nurse. The woman on the radio.

182
00:15:37,730 --> 00:15:39,720
接下来就轮到她们
They'll come for them next.

183
00:15:40,180 --> 00:15:43,330
还有多少老鼠要陪你们淹死
How many mice must drown with you?

184
00:15:46,150 --> 00:15:47,680
他话太多了
He talked too much.

185
00:15:57,270 --> 00:16:00,840
-克莱尔  马上穿好衣服  -怎么了
- Claire, I need you to get dressed. - What's going on?

186
00:16:01,220 --> 00:16:04,630
-你妈还在吗  -不  她跟阿姨回新泽西了
- Is your mom still here? - No, she's in Jersey with my tía.

187
00:16:05,030 --> 00:16:06,540
好的  我们得赶紧走
Okay. We need to go now.

188
00:16:06,540 --> 00:16:08,670
丹尼和科琳正在楼下帮我们盯梢
Danny and Colleen are downstairs keeping an eye out for us.

189
00:16:08,670 --> 00:16:10,040
盯梢
Keeping an eye out?

190
00:16:10,470 --> 00:16:11,900
到车里我再跟你解释
I'll explain everything in the car.

191
00:16:12,670 --> 00:16:14,470
你跟手和会打了一架
You took the fight to the Hand.

192
00:16:15,180 --> 00:16:17,560
开始很顺利  但现在我们都身处险境
It went well at first, but now we're all in danger.

193
00:16:19,740 --> 00:16:21,410
我真恨自己总能说对
I hate being right all the time.

194
00:16:22,180 --> 00:16:23,780
这种局面只会持续几天
It'll only be for a couple days.

195
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:25,760
你打算告诉我到底是怎么回事吗
So, are you gonna tell me what this is all about?

196
00:16:26,860 --> 00:16:29,560
目前来说  你知道的越少越好
At this point, the less you know, the better.

197
00:16:31,140 --> 00:16:32,390
你确定吗
Are you sure about that?

198
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:35,400
几天前  还是我把你介绍给丹尼·兰德
A couple days ago, I'm the one who introduced you to Danny Rand.

199
00:16:35,410 --> 00:16:37,610
对  可你还告诉我专注于自己
Yeah, and you also told me to focus on myself.

200
00:16:39,920 --> 00:16:41,780
我有点希望当时听了你的话
Part of me wishes I had listened.

201
00:16:44,030 --> 00:16:46,130
-对不起  -为什么
- I'm sorry. - For what?

202
00:16:47,950 --> 00:16:48,990
这一切
All of it.

203
