567
00:42:01,560 --> 00:42:05,950
一个警醒  我们在座所有人并非不可或缺
A reminder that everyone in this room is expendable.

568
00:42:06,700 --> 00:42:07,790
所有人
Everyone.

569
00:42:08,680 --> 00:42:10,090
也包括你
Including you.

570
00:42:11,960 --> 00:42:14,960
你似乎忘了我们发起这次任务的原因了
You seem to have forgotten why we started this mission.

571
00:42:16,640 --> 00:42:19,200
忘了我们为什么需要铁拳
Why we need the Iron Fist.

572
00:42:19,200 --> 00:42:20,510
不  我没忘
No, I haven't.

573
00:42:22,820 --> 00:42:25,910
原因就是我们都想活下去
It's because we all want to live to see another day.

574
00:42:26,330 --> 00:42:28,580
你是怕死了
You are afraid of dying.

575
00:42:29,020 --> 00:42:32,230
而我们只想活到回家的日子
We want to live long enough to go home.

576
00:42:33,030 --> 00:42:34,350
或许
Perhaps...

577
00:42:35,770 --> 00:42:39,330
我们该考虑把黑空剔除出计划了
it's time to make a plan without the Black Sky.

578
00:42:40,630 --> 00:42:43,160
或者剔除我们无畏的领袖
Or our fearless leader.

579
00:42:53,520 --> 00:42:55,090
我愿意与你合作
I was willing to work with you.

580
00:42:56,490 --> 00:42:57,770
但我怎么才能相信你
But how can I trust you?

581
00:43:01,860 --> 00:43:03,160
她的名字是艾丽卡
Her name is Elektra.

582
00:43:04,410 --> 00:43:07,770
她是他养大的  受训对抗手和会
She was raised by him. Trained to fight the Hand.

583
00:43:08,120 --> 00:43:10,080
她也战斗了  和我一起
Which she did, with me.

584
00:43:10,270 --> 00:43:11,360
直到他们相信
Until they convinced themselves

585
00:43:11,360 --> 00:43:13,090
她另有他用  就杀了她
she could serve another purpose and killed her.

586
00:43:13,090 --> 00:43:14,480
之前我看她可是活蹦乱跳的
She looked pretty alive back there.

587
00:43:14,480 --> 00:43:16,420
我知道  但我亲眼看着他们...
I know, but I was there when they...

588
00:43:20,540 --> 00:43:22,070
她就死在我的怀里
I was holding her when she died.

589
00:43:22,490 --> 00:43:24,040
死的是艾丽卡
Elektra died.

590
00:43:24,590 --> 00:43:27,560
和我们战斗的那个已经是别人了
That thing we've been fighting, it's something else.

591
00:43:28,370 --> 00:43:29,820
她被复活了
She was resurrected.

592
00:43:30,980 --> 00:43:31,910
对
Right.

593
00:43:33,770 --> 00:43:34,580
你怎么能不告诉我们
How come you didn't tell us?

594
00:43:34,580 --> 00:43:37,230
等等  你说"复活"是什么意思
Wait a minute. What do you mean, "resurrected"?

595
00:43:37,920 --> 00:43:39,760
他的前女友
His ex-girlfriend.

596
00:43:39,840 --> 00:43:41,470
现在他认为自己能拯救她
Now he thinks he can save her.

597
00:43:41,470 --> 00:43:42,820
所以你就差点害死我们
That's why you nearly got us killed?

598
00:43:42,820 --> 00:43:44,270
我呼唤她名字的时候  她有反应了
When I said her name, she recognized it.

599
00:43:44,340 --> 00:43:45,480
她认得我
She knew me, alright?

600
00:43:45,480 --> 00:43:47,320
他们在复活她的时候不管做了什么
I think whatever they did when they resurrected her,

601
00:43:47,320 --> 00:43:48,490
我觉得我都能触到她的内心
I think I can get through to her.

602
00:43:48,490 --> 00:43:49,390
先说清楚
Okay, to be clear,

603
00:43:49,390 --> 00:43:52,160
"复活"这个词我们已经说了三次了
we've now used the word "resurrected" three times.

604
00:43:52,160 --> 00:43:53,540
这就是他们的能耐
It's what they do.

605
00:43:54,790 --> 00:43:57,300
我们都答应了要开诚布公  马特
We agreed to put everything on the table, Matt.

606
00:43:57,310 --> 00:44:00,710
我们要想击败手和会  就必须得除掉她
If we're gonna defeat the Hand, we gotta take her out.

607
00:44:00,710 --> 00:44:02,300
不行  棍叟  我绝不允许
No, Stick. I won't allow it.

608
00:44:02,300 --> 00:44:04,320
你知道这些事对我们而言有多难相信吗
Do you know how hard this is for us to believe?

609
00:44:04,320 --> 00:44:07,270
你们信不信都不重要  说到底
It doesn't matter what you believe, at the end of the day...

610
00:44:07,270 --> 00:44:10,190
不管她是谁  她都是个问题
whatever she is, she's a problem.

611
00:44:11,140 --> 00:44:13,530
-撒谎也是个问题  -我并不想骗你们
- Lying is a problem. - I didn't wanna lie.

612
00:44:13,640 --> 00:44:16,000
-我只是想保护她  -我可不想
- I was trying to protect her. - Well, I'm not.

613
00:44:16,100 --> 00:44:18,060
而现在我最关心的人
And right now the people I care about

614
00:44:18,060 --> 00:44:19,480
被关在警察局里  就因为你
are held up in a precinct because you got me

615
00:44:19,480 --> 00:44:20,020
要我保护你的老相识
protecting some woman you used to know.

616
00:44:20,020 --> 00:44:22,170
别说得这么简单  卢克  我是想帮忙
Don't oversimplify it, Luke. I'm trying to help.

617
00:44:22,170 --> 00:44:24,240
真相就是这么简单  默多克
The truth is simple, Murdock.

618
00:44:26,690 --> 00:44:28,070
不许动
Don't move.

619
00:44:30,530 --> 00:44:32,170
我们也不必互相欺骗了
Let's not kid each other.

620
00:44:33,230 --> 00:44:35,540
这对我们每个人都是切身利益
This is personal for every one of us.

621
00:44:36,340 --> 00:44:38,360
但现在铁拳在我手里
But now I have the Iron Fist.

622
00:44:38,910 --> 00:44:41,200
手和会寻找的关键
The key to what the Hand seeks.

623
00:44:41,480 --> 00:44:44,850
是我们活命  救赎的钥匙
The key to life, to our salvation.

624
00:44:45,850 --> 00:44:46,900
战争结束了
The war is over.

625
00:44:50,460 --> 00:44:51,570
还早呢
Not yet.

626
00:45:10,030 --> 00:45:11,260
我的孩子
My child?

627
00:45:11,700 --> 00:45:13,180
我要和你谈谈
I need a word.

